# The deep searches run on the AI worker: Grandmaster Row (the Master's
# eight-ply search) answers two drops while the board keeps drawing, then
# Threefold Table's two rivals take their turns.
until 600 Make four in a row
frames 30
click =Challenges
until 120 Each challenge states its rules
frames 10
click =Grandmaster Row
until 120 The master, unassisted
frames 30
key Digit4 1
frames 5
until 3000 =Your turn
frames 5
key Digit3 1
frames 5
until 3000 =Your turn
frames 60
save master
key Escape 1
until 60 Leave to menu
frames 10
click =Leave to menu
until 120 Resume Grandmaster Row
frames 10
click =Challenges
until 120 Each challenge states its rules
frames 10
click =Threefold Table
until 120 Two rivals at one table
frames 30
key Digit4 1
frames 5
until 3000 =Your turn
frames 60
save threefold
expect Drops
